WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.378 --> 00:00:04.211
(classical music)

00:00:09.994 --> 00:00:10.988
- OMG.

00:00:10.988 --> 00:00:11.863
I love this band.

00:00:11.863 --> 00:00:14.503
- I've been listening to
'em for like, 17 years.

00:00:14.503 --> 00:00:16.101
Got all their albums
in cassette and vinyl.

00:00:16.101 --> 00:00:19.713
- Well I got my vinyl
signed at a pop up shop

00:00:19.713 --> 00:00:20.546
in Chinatown.

00:00:20.546 --> 00:00:22.164
- I caught 'em at the
mammal exhibit a while back.

00:00:22.164 --> 00:00:23.114
- The mammal exhibit?

00:00:23.114 --> 00:00:24.414
What is it, like a new venue?

00:00:24.414 --> 00:00:26.389
- No, no, at the Natural History Museum.

00:00:26.389 --> 00:00:27.468
Super chill.

00:00:27.468 --> 00:00:29.214
- Oh, chill.

00:00:29.214 --> 00:00:30.114
- Chill.

00:00:30.114 --> 00:00:31.189
Wanna grab a PBR?

00:00:31.189 --> 00:00:33.427
(crowd cheering)

00:00:33.427 --> 00:00:34.614
- I could just die right now.

00:00:34.614 --> 00:00:35.739
She is my goddess.

00:00:35.739 --> 00:00:36.579
- Tell me about it.

00:00:36.579 --> 00:00:38.779
I follow her on Instragram,
Snapchat, Facebook

00:00:38.779 --> 00:00:39.815
and Linkedin.

00:00:39.815 --> 00:00:42.077
- I don't even care that
it cost $400 for a ticket.

00:00:42.077 --> 00:00:44.302
- I totally quit my job
just so I could have

00:00:44.302 --> 00:00:45.665
enough time to buy these tickets online

00:00:45.665 --> 00:00:46.841
before they sold out.

00:00:46.841 --> 00:00:50.728
- [Group] We love you
person with only one name.

00:00:50.728 --> 00:00:52.803
- Man, this is my jam.

00:00:52.803 --> 00:00:53.636
- For sure.

00:00:53.636 --> 00:00:54.715
Ratmaster Jeffrey's the go.

00:00:54.715 --> 00:00:55.688
- But he isn't better than Jay-z.

00:00:55.688 --> 00:00:58.151
- Oh for sure, but
maybe better than Kanye.

00:00:58.151 --> 00:00:58.984
- Hold up.

00:00:58.984 --> 00:01:00.001
Better than Kanye?

00:01:00.001 --> 00:01:02.227
- Yeah, I'd pick him over Kanye,

00:01:02.227 --> 00:01:03.314
maybe even over Kendrick.

00:01:03.314 --> 00:01:04.231
- Kendrick?

00:01:06.289 --> 00:01:09.122
(classical music)

00:01:10.898 --> 00:01:14.607
- I love how the mandolin
and the windchimes

00:01:14.607 --> 00:01:16.971
just speak to my soul.

00:01:16.971 --> 00:01:18.157
- Your soul is beautiful.

00:01:18.157 --> 00:01:20.757
- Your soul is beautiful.

00:01:20.757 --> 00:01:22.120
- Shh.

00:01:22.120 --> 00:01:23.008
We should stop talking.

00:01:23.008 --> 00:01:25.649
We don't want our voices
to overpower the music.

00:01:25.649 --> 00:01:28.316
- You're right, let's just sway.

00:01:30.640 --> 00:01:31.881
- Oh my gosh, I love this song.

00:01:31.881 --> 00:01:32.718
- Tell me about it.

00:01:32.718 --> 00:01:34.608
She Looked Good in Her Camo
Wedding Dress is a classic.

00:01:34.608 --> 00:01:35.441
- You got that right.

00:01:35.441 --> 00:01:36.844
But it's not as good as that other song.

00:01:36.844 --> 00:01:37.919
- Which one is that?

00:01:37.919 --> 00:01:39.881
- You know the one about the
girl and the pickup truck?

00:01:39.881 --> 00:01:41.256
- I Love Her More Than My Pickup Truck?

00:01:41.256 --> 00:01:42.807
- No, no the other one.

00:01:42.807 --> 00:01:43.831
- I Knew She Was Alone When She Pulled Up

00:01:43.831 --> 00:01:45.471
in a Red Ram 2500?

00:01:45.471 --> 00:01:46.304
- That's the one.

00:01:46.304 --> 00:01:47.719
- You know who else is good?

00:01:47.719 --> 00:01:48.569
- Who?

00:01:48.569 --> 00:01:50.532
- That Miley girl.

00:01:50.532 --> 00:01:52.094
- How great is this mosh pit?

00:01:52.094 --> 00:01:53.697
- Yeah, I don't know, I've been in better.

00:01:53.697 --> 00:01:54.530
- Really?

00:01:54.530 --> 00:01:55.679
I feel I've gotten a couple good bruises.

00:01:55.679 --> 00:01:57.537
- Oh that's pretty good but is a mosh pit

00:01:57.537 --> 00:01:59.529
really a mosh pit if you
don't get your nose broken?

00:01:59.529 --> 00:02:01.655
- Do you remember the pit
back at the Dirty Cellar?

00:02:01.655 --> 00:02:02.741
- Awesome mosh pit.

00:02:02.741 --> 00:02:04.557
I got hit in the head with
like four beer bottles.

00:02:04.557 --> 00:02:06.429
- I got punched in the
face, kicked in the groin,

00:02:06.429 --> 00:02:07.929
and I got stabbed.

00:02:09.217 --> 00:02:10.667
Mosh pit.
- Mosh pit.

00:02:10.667 --> 00:02:12.829
(wild music)

00:02:12.829 --> 00:02:15.505
(classical music)

00:02:15.505 --> 00:02:17.755
(clapping)

00:02:18.957 --> 00:02:21.707
(country music)

